    "methods_description": "EEG data were acquired using a Biosemi system during laser pain stimulation. Participants received fixed-intensity pain stimuli (3J/3.5J for participants 1-135; 3.5J/4J for participants 136-142) in three blocks of 10 stimuli each. Following each stimulus, participants provided pain intensity ratings on a 0-10 scale after a 5-second pause. Participants were instructed to maintain fixation on a crosshair display and keep their eyes open throughout the experiment.",
